<section class="border-b-2 border-gray-900 py-16 lg:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-900 mb-2">2025 Survey Report</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-gray-900 tracking-tight mb-4">
          The State of Private AI
        </h2>
        <p class="text-gray-500 font-medium text-base leading-relaxed mb-6">
          We surveyed 300+ engineering teams to understand how enterprises are deploying self-hosted AI — and where compliance gaps remain.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 mb-8">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-bold text-gray-700">
            <span class="w-5 h-5 bg-primary-500 border-2 border-gray-900 flex items-center justify-center text-gray-900 text-xs font-black flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
            78% of teams self-host at least one model in production
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-bold text-gray-700">
            <span class="w-5 h-5 bg-primary-500 border-2 border-gray-900 flex items-center justify-center text-gray-900 text-xs font-black flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
            Top concern: data residency and egress costs
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-bold text-gray-700">
            <span class="w-5 h-5 bg-primary-500 border-2 border-gray-900 flex items-center justify-center text-gray-900 text-xs font-black flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
            License compliance is the #1 blocker for procurement
          </li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/survey"
          class="inline-flex items-center h-12 border-2 border-gray-900 px-6 font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-xs bg-gray-900 text-white hover:bg-primary-500 hover:border-primary-500 transition-all no-underline">
          Download Free Report <span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-2">↓</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 border-2 border-gray-900 p-6 lg:p-8">
        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-primary-100 border-2 border-primary-500 text-primary-700 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider mb-4 inline-block">Preview</span>
        <div class="space-y-4">
